WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:04.460
Big news, big news!

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.010
Big news!

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:09.070
I managed to get into the Cartado Festival!

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.440
Huh?

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.820
Once a year, the Tarkas, 
the only manufacturers

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.330
of Cartado in the world,
host a Cartado Festival!

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.670
It's a private festival that 
outsiders can't participate in,

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:22.210
so it's a secret festival that 
most only ever read about!

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:23.280
And I...

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.060
got invited...

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.480
to attend!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.590
Uh, and who's that?

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.010
This is Dodo-san,

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:40.640
the Tarka I met and bonded with
 at my usual Cartado shop.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.620
He's allowing me to participate!

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.440
So cute!

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.940
Sit here!

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.190
Would you like some snacks?

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.690
Have some tea!

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.660
So cute!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.370
I'm Seira. Nice to meet you!

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:01.080
Um, so about the Cartado Festival...

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.750
I'm Yusha!

00:00:58.750 --> 00:00:59.940
I'm Fai!

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.080
Are the snacks good?

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.960
You've all wasted no time in making friends.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.810
Do you like the snacks?

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:10.990
Yet it took me months to do that...

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:10.990
Those snacks taste good!

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:26.770
Endro!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:47.520
Roll 9

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:58.930
"This way, path to village." I see.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:03.030
So this cave leads to Tarka Village, then.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:06.910
Well, that means this is as 
far as you girls can come.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.040
What?!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.670
Don't "What?!" me!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.320
There are lots of evil merchants

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:16.590
who'd love to know how to get to 
Tarka Village, where Cartado originate.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.300
It's not a place outsiders can just waltz into.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.300
It was a miracle that I received 
permission from Dodo-san,

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.160
so I'm going to the Tarka Village 
I've longed to see

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.310
and attending that Cartado Festival!

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.560
He says, "You girls can come, too!"

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.970
Fai-san! Don't say such ridiculous things
 just because you want to come.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:40.210
"You all, come, village, welcome."

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.320
Wait, you're right.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.030
How did you understand him?!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.340
I just kind of did.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.500
Wild instincts, maybe?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.060
So does that mean it's okay 
for us to go to the village?

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.210
Yay!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.320
Yay!

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:00.900
It is okay to be taking this so lightly?

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:12.100
Looks like this is a dead end.

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.780
Wow, a huge hole!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.280
Huh? What's going on?

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.530
Sounds like he's telling us to jump down.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:27.910
She's right.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:28.790
Huh?!

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.410
N-No way, no way, no way, no way!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.360
He really went.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.250
All right, here I go!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.150
Me, too!

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:38.670
Huh?!

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.800
This is for the Cartado Festival!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.400
Fine!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.160
H-How were they able to 
jump without hesitation?!

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.440
Am I just fussing too much?!

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:57.440
Yusha-san and Fai-san are just special.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.140
But you're not panicking, either!

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.330
I'm panicking quite a bit.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.120
It doesn't seem that way at all.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.200
I'm the type who'd drown in a river 
without anyone ever noticing.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.920
That's a scary thing to just let slip!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.280
What's that?

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:18.560
Probably a gate or something 
that leads to the village.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.960
Then we'll be in the village 
once we pass through!

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:24.840
Yahoo! We're there!

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.620
I wish it could've dropped us 
out a little more gently.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.990
Those are...

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.370
What odd trees.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.250
It looks like they're bearing 
paper instead of fruit.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.450
They are!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:02.030
Those are the Cartado trees I've 
always, always wanted to see,

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.860
ever since I read about them!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:06.130
What?!

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.970
I didn't know Cartado grew on trees.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.830
I always thought some powerful mage

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.900
was using some kind of special magic circle

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:20.520
to raise his power and imbue 
the spells into cards.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.030
Me, too!

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:26.530
Yes! That's part of what 
makes Cartado so deep!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.250
Cartado aren't manufactured 
items created by man.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.680
They're a product of nature 
grown from the land itself!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.820
Wow.

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:36.850
There are all kinds of Cartado 
growing from a single tree.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.300
That's another part of their mystery!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.290
From what I've researched,

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.380
the stronger theory is 
that the earth of this land

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.800
produces Cartado more so than the trees.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:50.010
Wow, that's strange.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.290
Are those Tarka children?

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:57.560
Wow! They're wearing such cute outfits!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.090
What are they saying?

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:10.070
Uh, they said they're wearing that attire
because today's the festival day.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.620
I see.

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:14.210
You've just accepted Fai's intuition, huh?

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.680
When I thought about it,

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.580
it's easier having an interpreter 
than translating from a book.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.760
Hey!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.610
Cartado are precious!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:31.590
You have to handle them with care!

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.210
My goodness.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.810
He said it's no big deal, 
since they grow every year.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.880
He also said you all can have 
some as well, if you want.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:43.540
Huh?!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.980
Seriously?!

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:46.860
I'll take this one!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:50.490
This one! And that one! They're mine!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.160
Calm down, Mei-chan!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.940
I'll take all of the Cartado here!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:53.940
Calm down!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:55.830
You'll break your staff!

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.670
I lost myself in this paradise.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.260
So this is Tarka Village.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:17.000
I'm finally setting foot in the forbidden 
village that keeps outsiders out!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.100
Everyone, make sure you're 
not rude to the villagers.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:27.800
They're welcoming us?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.910
They're really friendly!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:36.790
He said everyone's really happy, 
since they rarely get any visitors.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.170
They're nice people.

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:41.800
This is even more reason to make sure 
others don't find out about it!

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:44.540
We'd better keep the way here a secret!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:48.700
But frankly, I do want to brag about this a bit.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.830
Hey, now. Keep your fanaticism in check.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:54.150
I know!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.030
My lips are sealed!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.460
He says, "Let's get you changed 
into the festival attire!"

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.540
Oh! We get to wear that, too?!

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.190
I want to wear it!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.010
H-Huh?

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.570
It won't go up any higher.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.950
It's catching at my chest.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.330
Hup!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.830
Yes! I got it on!

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.220
Uh...

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.350
He says they have larger ones!

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:46.600
I got it on! It's so cute!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:50.730
It fits perfectly! It's so easy to move in!

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:54.860
I was worried there for a moment.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:59.950
The first one fit me just fine.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.420
He says this is the main area for the festival.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:10.900
He says the festival's about to start.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.760
It's finally time!

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:16.950
I'm actually present at this huge event

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:21.480
that Cartado fans worldwide would 
drool over: the Cartado Festival.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:26.140
The only harvest festival that celebrates 
and honors a crop of Cartado!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:35.500
He says they're going to sing 
the Cartado Festival song.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.140
Huh?

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:37.150
Song?

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.950
He telling us to sing along.

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:51.670
Huh? But we don't know the words.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:56.920
I guess it doesn't matter 
if we don't know them.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:58.370
Yeah!

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.660
Then let's just sing something!

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:45.250
He says that they're now going to compete 
to determine this year's Cartado King.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.960
Cartado King?

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.980
I've read about this before.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.880
It's the main event of the festival.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:53.530
Every year they compete to collect

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:56.730
Cartado from the wild Cartado 
trees growing around the village,

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.880
and not the cultivated ones,

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.680
and whoever manages to harvest 
the most wonderful Cartado

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:04.990
becomes that year's Cartado King...

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.740
the star of the festival!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.180
Really? That sounds fun!

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:12.490
You do like that sort of thing.

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:16.320
He says anyone can participate.

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:18.000
All right! Let's do it!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:18.920
Of course!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.680
"Ready," he says.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.450
"Start," he says.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:28.810
I got that!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.480
All right, let's do our best!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.090
If we're doing this, let's aim to be King!

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:35.970
Of course!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.540
Let's do it!

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.790
There's one!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:58.800
Huh?

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:02.000
He says you can't become King 
with the ones found around here.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.480
You need to find rarer ones.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:07.300
I see. I read about this before.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.380
The rarer a Cartado is,
 the more difficult it is to harvest.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:14.010
And even in the wild,
 they grow only on trees in difficult places.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:17.060
I guess everything's been written in books.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.220
That's right!

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:20.130
Generations of Cartado fans have

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:23.690
continued their unyielding 
pursuit to record it all!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.450
He says to go this way.

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:33.580
Are you saying we have to climb this?

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.720
He says so.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.830
Of course...

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:49.740
I'm great at this stuff! Yahoo!

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.690
That looks fun!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:57.230
Those two really are full of energy,
 aren't they, Mei?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:58.990
Mei?

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.400
Seira-san!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.620
My heart's dancing so hard
at this opportunity

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:06.990
to experience harvesting 
rare Cartado in the wild!

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:11.260
Also, if I manage to become Cartado King
 at the legendary Cartado Festival,

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:14.750
I'll be able to brag for life among fans!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.240
I guess so.

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:20.690
Uh, the Cartado tree is...

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:22.480
Oh, there!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:23.250
No!

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.840
That's not a rare one!

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.870
Huh? You can tell from this far away?

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.090
Of course!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:33.530
I can tell Cartado apart even from so 
far away that they look like specks!

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:35.980
By the way, that's a "Toad Voice."

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:38.590
Y-You can even tell that much?

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.410
By the way, what kind of spell is that?

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.430
One that makes your voice 
sound like a frog's.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.060
What would you even use that for?

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:46.610
Oh, I found one!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.110
Is that rare?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.940
Yusha-san! That's a legendary rare Cartado!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:56.500
Huh? Really?!

00:14:57.070 --> 00:15:00.100
All right! Here I go!

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:04.130
Leave it to me!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:08.380
I got it!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.220
Fai-chan!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.220
Fai-san!

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.810
That was close.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.500
They're taking it!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.610
Too bad.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.540
Not yet! Dodo!

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:48.760
I guess this makes that person Cartado King.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.380
Really?

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.590
I mean, it was a legendary rare, right?

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.310
You aren't going to find two or three of them.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:59.540
But it looks like Mei-chan 
hasn't given up yet.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:03.310
That's a common. That's a common, too.

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.770
That's... an ordinary rare.

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:08.900
Mei, are you looking for legendary rares?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:13.050
Oh! Maybe we can find a mythic rare
 like the one Rona-chan has!

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.530
Impossible.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.610
There are only a few mythic 
rares in the entire world.

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:20.410
They're all said to be given from God

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:24.090
and passed down for 
generations since long ago.

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:28.470
There's no written record of any 
being found growing on trees.

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:32.300
But there's still a chance that 
we might find a legendary rare.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.940
Besides, even if I don't become Cartado King,

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:39.560
I'm getting to participate in the 
Cartado Festival I dreamed of!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.790
I'm going to keep at it until time's up

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:46.690
and enjoy this moment I dreamed of,
 for as long as possible!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.110
Mei-chan...

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.070
Mei...

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.180
Then I'll help you now, Mei-chan!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.260
Yeah.

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.840
I've never seen Mei this passionate before.

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:58.450
What should we do? Ask away!

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:02.210
Dodo says he'll help, too!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.260
Everyone...

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:05.710
Thank you!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.100
Let's call it quits.

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:35.610
Huh?

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.800
You're giving up?

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:42.370
I'm searching for something
 we're not likely to find anyway.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.370
And the sun's about to set,
 so we're getting close to the end.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:51.880
Thank you all for coming along with me today.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.300
That's...

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.600
Mei-chan?

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:05.640
Oh! It's a Cartado!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.060
It is.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:10.140
It must have gotten buried 
in a landslide or something.

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.030
But this is...

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.730
Th-This is...

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.020
Huh?!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.550
It's a huge Cartado!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.370
I wonder if it's a mutation.

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:30.040
How are you so calm with such 
a rare Cartado before you?!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.880
You might be able to become 
King with this one!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.870
It's rare, all right,

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:40.640
but this is just a one-star common.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.820
Still!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.630
We should try entering with it,
 since we found it!

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:46.140
It'll stand out, at least!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.560
Well, in that case...

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:01.160
Huh? What?

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:09.140
He says he sees legendary rares 
about once every few years,

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:12.020
but he's never seen a Cartado this big!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:14.260
It's wonderful!

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:15.620
We did it!

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:17.920
Mei-chan, you're Cartado King!

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:24.680
I-I'm Cartado King?

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.690
What kind of bonus do you get 
for becoming Cartado King?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.920
He says that's it.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:40.700
Huh? We worked so hard just for that?

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.010
Well, who cares?

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.890
Mei-chan seems happy.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.120
Uh-huh!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.710
I suppose.

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:55.970
He says it's time for the festival's finale.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.780
Are those Cartado?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:01.500
They're the wild Cartado 
everyone picked today.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:05.210
They do that to offer them up to the gods.

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:09.320
I see. It is a harvest festival, after all.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.730
I can't wait to see what the finale is!

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:20.210
Huh?!

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:22.440
They lit them on fire?!

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:24.910
Wh-What's going on, Dodo?!

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.700
Uh, he says they do this 
to offer all the Cartado

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:36.920
everyone's gathered to the heavens as 
a prayer for a good harvest next year.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:40.250
Huh?! Even that legendary rare Cartado?!

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.570
What a waste!

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:44.270
Mei-chan's jumbo Cartado 
is going to burn up, too!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:46.400
Can we take that one back, at least?!

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.180
No!

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:55.120
As a Cartado fan,
 I have respect for the Cartado,

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:59.940
and thus I must respect the Cartado Festival 
and Tarka Village, where they're produced!

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:02.490
If this is part of this village's culture,

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.510
we have no right to stop them!

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:08.090
Mei-chan...

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:10.870
Yeah, you're right!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.710
That's our Mei-chan!

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.080
<i>Ah... It's so beautiful.</i>

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:49.240
<i>I'm really glad I got to come here.</i>

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:53.760
<i>The world of Cartado is truly deep.</i>

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:01.460
<i>But still,</i>

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:04.420
<i>it's such a waste.</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Snowy Mountain Dream!

00:23:36.070 --> 00:23:38.380
"Snowy Mountain Dream!"
